"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":246178,\"title\":\"The Indrani Mukerjea Story: Buried Truth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bnKsvPH5QnXofRHwO9AJiWhRDPO.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41714285714285715,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":97062,\"title\":\"Killer Inside: The Mind of Aaron Hernandez\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2MfrqxkMGIqsCHYTz2pMhEoOJpB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4166666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63424,\"title\":\"The Perfect Murder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Cc9oBlUzeHO9YJFk7UHKmv7tAT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4101123595505618,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":130228,\"title\":\"Debi Marshall Investigates: Frozen Lies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/su27szZWFjX4KYjIoAO8hEIhsyV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nTTykzrrFc785s604Em5jPsQJ8p.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2012-07-26\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"A Tale of Two Sisters\",\"overview\":\"Identical twins, Sunny and Jeena Han were born just five minutes apart, but it might as well been five years. The younger twin lived in the shadow of her elder sister for decades, jealously ultimately driving her to order a hit on her older sister.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cwo1dLk79TmxEPAEhT8cuzbAaDk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Bad Seeds\",\"overview\":\"Profiling twins who were each convicted of murder.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-02\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"My Brother’s Keeper\",\"overview\":\"Greg and Jeff Henry were identical twins that lived nearly identical lives, and were inseparable. One terrible night a Henry brother shot his twin in a drunken rage. Can the close bond between twins become too close and ultimately lead to murder?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ueYHbO7UFfI9xDt0Dn3MCM6C5I.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-08-09\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Trust Fund Terror\",\"overview\":\"Identical twins Tim and Todd Nicholson were born with Hollywood good looks and matching trust funds. With a mother who never bothered to tell them apart, they lived fast and furiously, and one would die young, at the hands of his own brother.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v99SnCVXyd0mrTMXAxuW7dsjbJg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-01\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Tribe of Two\",\"overview\":\"When a mail bomb explodes in the hands of an African American government official in Scottsdale, Arizona, all signs point to twins and avowed racists, Dennis and Daniel Mahon. An ex-stripper spends five years undercover to help put them behind bars.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hl6A8xIgKGQUtc13IuQjbfLuMjg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Double Barrel\",\"overview\":\"An officer is murdered by identical twins Joel and Michael Stovall. The heavily armed duo soon hijack a pickup and lead law enforcement on high-speed shootout through the Colorado mountains. The 60-mile chase finally ends with a dramatic shootout.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cLXMeMrTqk5gHW5rD2qcpMM3aGN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Dante and Donte's Inferno\",\"overview\":\"Twins Donte and Dante Hall were born into hell. With a delinquent father and a drug addict mother, they had to get tough early. One night in 2006, the Hall twins plot a bold armed robbery using strippers as bait, it would all go horribly wrong.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fIqQEJsJzBsrKSJyeveZal2Pjsb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Twisted Sisters\",\"overview\":\"Twins Betty and Peggy Woods survived an abusive home in rural Alabama. Years later, Peggy and Betty, stark opposites, are both tragically caught up in a sorted murder-for-hire plot.  And only the hit man knows which twin was guilty.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g7fntbEadaH6fdwLCqKAG5SW6a2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-12\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Blood Brothers\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePABZwIStdP49nn45pU6qw5k5w7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Twin Kings of London\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-14\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Roofie Romeos\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-30\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Sisters In Silence\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8DLBHguFHko7Qir3o4JsmT9wCWS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-06\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-07-26\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}